description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-01T14:58:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:14Z","closed_at":"2025-03-28T16:36:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99897","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99897.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99897.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-28T16:36:10Z"},"body":"The current API for EditorSelection has this `get_transformable_selected_nodes` function exposed to scripting:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"800\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-01 at 6 46 04 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a67d088-8eed-4852-9570-2264c0b29a65\">\r\n\r\nIt is not immediately obvious what \"transformable\" means. One could assume that it only returns Node3D/CanvasItem nodes since those have a global transform, but that is not correct, it can return plain `Node` nodes too. What it actually does is return top nodes, which is useful for transform operations. For example, if there is a node A with a child B and a sibling C, then selecting all three will cause this method to return only A and C. Changing the global transform of A will affect the global transform of B, so there is no need to change B separately.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, a problem with the current API is that the `TypedArray<Node>` version of this function is not available internally, which makes it impossible to write C++ code that works for both engine modules and GDExtension - you'd need `#if` directives to swap between this function and the internal `List<Node *>` version.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the following changes:\r\n\r\n* Rename `_get_transformable_selected_nodes` to `get_top_selected_nodes`.\r\n* Change the visibility of `get_top_selected_nodes` to public.\r\n* Expose the new name to scripting, but keep the old name as a deprecated alias to avoid breaking compatibility.\r\n* Rename the internal variable `selected_node_list` to `top_selected_node_list` for clarity.\r\n* For parity with the above, rename internal `get_selected_node_list` to `get_top_selected_node_list`.\r\n  * This part makes up over half of the files changed in this PR.\r\n  * This can break compatibility with third-party modules if they use this function.\r\n    * As such, we should exclude this part if we want to cherry-pick this to 4.4 and earlier to keep modules working within patch releases of the same minor version.\r\n* Update the documentation to clarify what this API does.\r\n\r\nNote: I did not change the other function that returns all selected nodes.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99897/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99897/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}